MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_Kou_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_Kou_m01_001: Have you seen enough? We'll leave when\nyou're ready.
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_Kou_m01_002: <ICA>"I'm ready."
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_Kou_m01_003: <ICB>"Not yet."
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_Kou_m01_004: <ACA>Alright. Then we'll teleport to Katarina, one of the\nGrand Oracles.
MID_LGA_0XXX_c02_Kou_m01: <BLN>Have you seen enough?
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B01_m01_001: You're not...risen dead, right? It's been so long since\nI've met another living soul.
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B01_m01_002: This is a surprise. I wasn't expecting to encounter\nhumans hiding here.
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B01_m01_003: After that war, the world went to hell. And then\nthings kept getting worse.
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B01_m01_004: The risen dead flooded out of those awful gates...\nand the people they killed rose up to join them!
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B01_m01_005: Why aren't the gods doing anything about the\nhorrible state of our world?!
MID_LGA_0XXX_c02_B01_m01: <BLN>You're not...risen dead, right?
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B02_m01_001: We're all done for. It's only a matter of time before\nwe die at the hands of the risen dead and go extinct!
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B02_m01_002: I don't want to die. I'll do anything! Just don't\nlet me die!
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B02_m01_003: But wait...you're not with the dead armies roaming\nall over Dagda.
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B02_m01_004: I can't believe it! How did any surviving humans\nmake it all the way here?
MID_LGA_0XXX_c02_B02_m01: <BLN>I don't want to die!
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B03_m01_001: Our home was attacked by the risen dead. We barely\nescaped here with our lives.
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B03_m01_002: We brought as much food and water as we could,\nbut who knows how long it'll last.
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B03_m01_003: Still, I refuse to starve to death or let those damned\nrisen dead kill me!
MID_LGA_0XXX_c02_B03_m01: <BLN>I don't know how long we can last.
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B04_m01_001: We barely escaped to this cave with our lives, and\nnow we have to deal with risen dead here too?!
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B04_m01_002: Are we doomed to hide here from those monsters,\nwaiting in terror until we die?
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B04_m01_003: How long can we survive here, anyway? Surely help\nwill come someday...
MID_LGA_0XXX_c02_B04_m01: <BLN>Are we not even safe here?!
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B05_m01_001: A few survivors tried to run off with the food and\nwater, the only supplies we have in the world.
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B05_m01_002: They were caught, and everyone ganged up on them,\nand soon enough they were dead.
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B05_m01_003: But then...they rose up again and started prowling\naround this cave.
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B05_m01_004: Some of us went mad with terror. They ran off\nsomewhere and I haven't seen them since.
MID_LGV_0XXX_c02_B05_m01_005: We're all at the end of our ropes here. None of us\nknow how long we can take this...
MID_LGA_0XXX_c02_B05_m01: <BLN>I can't hold out forever...